<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Green Lakes from Dutchman Flat by the Crater Creek Ditch</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:269-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.999772" lon="-121.663687"><ele>1935.4</ele><name>Dutchman Flat Sno-park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin (OSM way 559496151); confidence: high; pdf_page: 267; book_elev_ft: 6400; quote: map 60: DUTCHMAN FLAT NORDIC SNO-PARK 6400'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.028440" lon="-121.665390"><ele>1974.7</ele><name>Little Meadow (Big Meadow Trail / Pete's Way)</name><desc>source: OSM junction of the nordic Big Meadow Trail (way 1467651000) and Pete's Way (way 662808005); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 268; book_elev_ft: 6450; quote: in 2.2 miles from the sno-park it enters Little Meadow ... Both Pete's Way and Swampy Lakes Trails exit from this meadow</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.034030" lon="-121.677070"><ele>2001.4</ele><name>Big Meadow west end (road 370)</name><desc>source: OSM node where Big Meadow Trail, Todd Ridge Trail and NF 370 meet; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 270; book_elev_ft: 6450; quote: then to the west end of Big Meadow and up the road to a blufftop viewpoint (PDF 270); Todd Ridge trail starts at the west end of Big Meadow (PDF 268)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.037790" lon="-121.671790"><ele>2058.7</ele><name>Blufftop viewpoint on road 370</name><desc>source: point on OSM NF 370 0.4 mi by road before the 370/378 junction (map 60 '0.4'); georef of the map dot gives 44.0354,-121.6715, 270 m away; confidence: low; pdf_page: 267; book_elev_ft: 6700; quote: up the road to a blufftop viewpoint; map 60: 6700' star, 0.4 to 6780'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.041652" lon="-121.667439"><ele>2069.6</ele><name>Road 370 / 378 junction (6,780 ft)</name><desc>source: OSM junction NF 370 x NF 378 (road to Crater Ditch trailhead = map's Crater Ck Ditch route); 0.84 mi by road to the 370/380 junction vs map 0.8; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 267; book_elev_ft: 6780; quote: map 60: 6780' junction, CRATER CK DITCH ROUTE TO LOWER CRATER</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.046868" lon="-121.673783"><ele>2085.3</ele><name>Crater Ditch Trailhead (road 378 meets the ditch)</name><desc>source: vertex of OSM Crater Creek Ditch (way 559391732) 36 m from the OSM 'Crater Ditch Trailhead' parking (way 559391734), at the end of NF 378 (way 357558097); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 267; quote: map 60: CRATER CK DITCH ROUTE TO LOWER CRATER, 2.0 from the 6780' junction</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.061032" lon="-121.688041"><ele>2099.2</ele><name>Lower crater: ditch meets Broken Top Trail #10</name><desc>source: USFS/OSM Broken Top Trail #10 point 142 m from the west end of the OSM Crater Creek Ditch, 0.97 mi along #10 from the Broken Top trailhead; DEM 6,880 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 270; quote: along the very foot of the butte on the Crater Creek Ditch around to the west side and into the lower crater (PDF 270)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.080800" lon="-121.730700"><ele>1995.6</ele><name>Green Lakes (south lake, end of Broken Top Trail #10)</name><desc>source: west end of OSM Broken Top Trail #10 (way 367548069) at Green Lakes Trail #17, beside the southern Green Lake (OSM way 278226269); confidence: high; pdf_page: 271; book_elev_ft: 6500; quote: The three lakes lying in a 6,500-foot saddle between South Sister and Broken Top</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Green Lakes from Dutchman Flat by the Crater Creek Ditch</name><desc>1. Dutchman Flat Sno-park -&gt; Little Meadow (Big Meadow Trail / Pete's Way): osm (high), 2.57 mi | 2. Little Meadow (Big Meadow Trail / Pete's Way) -&gt; Big Meadow west end (road 370): osm (high), 0.91 mi | 3. Big Meadow west end (road 370) -&gt; Blufftop viewpoint on road 370: osm (high), 0.63 mi | 4. Blufftop viewpoint on road 370 -&gt; Road 370 / 378 junction (6,780 ft): osm (high), 0.47 mi | 5. Road 370 / 378 junction (6,780 ft) -&gt; Crater Ditch Trailhead (road 378 meets the ditch): osm (high), 0.50 mi | 6. Crater Ditch Trailhead (road 378 meets the ditch) -&gt; Lower crater: ditch meets Broken Top Trail #10: line (high), 1.56 mi | 7. Lower crater: ditch meets Broken Top Trail #10 -&gt; Green Lakes (south lake, end of Broken Top Trail #10): osm (medium), 3.84 mi</desc>
